    "reason": "[ev-85eccdc718e3] and [ev-2941a875a468] describe a new optional upgrade path: users who used `kubectl apply` \"can continue to do so\" and \"can begin safely upgrading\" with `helm upgrade istio-base`. No operator step is mandatory, so the change is not migration-required, and the migration family (which only allows migration-required) is the wrong subject. The underlying chart change is CRDs templated by default, with `Values.base.enableCRDTemplates` deprecated [ev-fa194382072a]. That is a separate release-note item on a different subject, which this text does not name, so no corrected assertion follows from this item.",
